        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIaAtr">VIIa Atr</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ealle gemænelice, gehadode ⁊ læwede, bugan to Gode georne ⁊ geearnian his mildse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And all men with one accord, both clerics and laymen, shall zealously turn to God and obtain his mercy.</ab>
